Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.75,0:00:09.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別掉下去啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:10.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:16.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,薇洛妮卡大人的妓院“魅魔之翼”倒了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,業績掉那麼多喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:23.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是物理性損壞\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:25.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,物理性的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:30.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你說店被砸爛了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:32.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,天譴啦天譴！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:41.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我從貧民窟白手起家努力打拚…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:44.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易才開起來的店耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒… 沒必要哭成這樣吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:48.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:52.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,回城牆的時候 可以陪我一起回去嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:55.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我得把店重建起來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:57.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以可能付不出太多錢…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:00.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有點不安…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:03.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雅那戈啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拜託你了 始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:09.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真拿你沒辦法啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你 始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:14.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有男生在就覺得安心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:19.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上當了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:23.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,店裡的孩子們都平安吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:26.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,平安 是不幸中的大幸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:29.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊 太好了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:33.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過… 要是是有人故意弄壞我的店…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:37.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我就讓他見識什麼叫做地獄\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.95,0:02:04.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:18.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第6話 決戰！迷宮攻略）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:21.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好大的建築耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:22.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:26.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們追著影子跑！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:27.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:34.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老樣子 這面牆把影子拉得真長\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:37.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦好啦 別裝帥了 走吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:40.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我… 我又不是在裝帥！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:46.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我的店！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:48.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被弄得好亂喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:50.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,下手挺狠的嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:54.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不能跨進線內喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:03:58.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是老闆娘？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:02.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這不是瑪莉貝兒嗎？ 你在幹嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:03.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,打工啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:05.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可忙死我了你知道嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:08.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你的店不是倒了嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:09.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且把它弄壞的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好久不見呀薇洛妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雀斑潔西！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:20.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不要叫我雀斑！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:20.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（用化妝遮起來了）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:22.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過真可惜呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:24.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看起來你的店沒了耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:28.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,果然是你幹的啊… 我要殺了你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:31.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才… 才不是我咧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:32.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,店會倒\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:35.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是薄霧龍來休息啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:36.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是真的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.23,0:04:39.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天早上公會也公告了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:42.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,半夜飛來的薄霧龍\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:44.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在店的屋頂上歇翅的時候\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:47.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,屋頂承受不了重量所以塌了啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:50.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了！魔物災害保險\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:52.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就只有龍的部分\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:54.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我沒保啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:57.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好感謝我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你店裡那些沒地方去的孩子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:01.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我都先幫你收留了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是挺好的嘛 薇洛妮卡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:05.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那位姐姐是個好人耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:07.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她可沒那麼好心…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:08.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那女人啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:12.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是交易 店修好之前\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:15.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那些女孩就由我來照顧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:17.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,相對的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:20.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把利夏特大人…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:22.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,從奴隸待遇中解放！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.61,0:05:23.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:25.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:30.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,狗狗來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:31.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,汪！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:34.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是這樣啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:37.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在叫你不要這樣對待他啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,說起來 你不是喜歡上這傢伙了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:45.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這個啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:48.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你願意出全額重建費用\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:50.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也許可以考慮一下喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:52.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也太貪了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:58.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你不會乖乖答應啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:01.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就來場地下城突襲如何？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:03.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你贏的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:05.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,重建費用我可以出一半\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.65,0:06:11.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但你要是輸了就放走利夏特大人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:12.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而你要當我的僕人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:14.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好好為我工作！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊… 求之不得！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:23.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雖然這麼說啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:25.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這下有點不妙呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:27.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這很好吃喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:30.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在說吃的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:33.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對方把地下城地圖都掃光了不說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:35.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還僱了虎人隊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:37.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-就是啊…\n-虎人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:38.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（迷宮“高文的祭壇”專精的\n冒險者隊伍　虎人）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:41.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他們先下手為強了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:44.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡那個女人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請放心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:49.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,若是輸了… 我就不能待在您身邊了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼我利夏特…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:53.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明天就拿出真本事吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:57.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,輸了也沒關係吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:01.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:03.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要她出重建費啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,味噌炸兔排好好吃 始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:07.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:10.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（迷宮“高文的祭壇”）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:13.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虧你趕來呢薇洛妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,準備好了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:18.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,完全來不及\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:20.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝您！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼你要打利夏特大人？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:27.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,本場比賽是五對五的團隊戰\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:29.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把中頭目\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:32.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,“復甦之魔物”打倒的隊伍獲勝\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.07,0:07:36.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 地下城突襲開始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:40.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,命令是最速攻略\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:41.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,全力上吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:42.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 不要丟下我啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:54.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特大人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:06.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特大人…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹嘛！笨蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:12.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,比賽途中別給我受虐癖發作啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:14.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:16.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那陷阱看起來不錯就忍不住了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:20.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你對利夏特大人做什麼啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:21.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,亂成一團啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:24.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虎人隊要先走了啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:26.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐會輸掉的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:29.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,給我更多…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:37.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看起來是死路耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:43.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,銅等級冒險者莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:44.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被死路擋住了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:07.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,隱… 隱藏樓梯！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:10.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（另一方面 此時…）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:19.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是寶箱！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:30.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛 是大人用的喔…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,少廢話先穿\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,迷宮寶箱中出現的裝備啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,會變成第一個穿的人的尺寸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:04.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好強！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:06.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那可不一定\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:09.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不能這樣白費時間！得快點！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:11.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦好啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:16.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（復甦之魔物LV.15　金鯱步行者）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始 有個奇怪金光閃閃的東西\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:26.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大概那傢伙就是頭目魔物\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是說了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:35.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這時候就別攔我啦 始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:37.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,當然要攔！以你現在等級\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:39.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,硬打是不可能的啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:42.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要打就拉開距離用魔法\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:44.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:47.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的魔法只能做魔法淋浴喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:50.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正先試著放放看吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這段時間等級也升了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:54.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,裝備也換新了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:57.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我覺得莉露用劍\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.36,0:11:00.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,應該比用棒子更強耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:03.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是棒子是法杖 放輕鬆放輕鬆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:12.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看來莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,果然比較有這方面的天份啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:31.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們的獵物！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最後一擊由莉露收下了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:36.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你還真敢講啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:39.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這死小鬼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:43.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,小小年紀還挺能打嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:46.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 空檔抓得真好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:48.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這年紀能這樣很厲害呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:50.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露其實用劍比較強\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:52.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但拿棍子也很了不起啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.79,0:11:55.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被搶怪你都不會生氣的嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:06.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等… 已經被打倒了啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:10.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哪… 哪邊贏？始？還是虎人？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:14.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,咦？小莉露？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:19.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的！小莉露好厲害！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:21.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還行啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:23.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露其實蠻厲害的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:24.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,輸了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.07,0:12:27.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了！半額半額\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:29.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝啦 你們兩個\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:37.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:43.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:44.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,超帥的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.63,0:12:46.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的好帥喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:49.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對吧對吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:52.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是為了我們才出手的吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:53.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,當然囉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:55.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真可靠\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:04.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始 不是要去買伴手禮嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:06.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你幹嘛啦莉露！正嗨著呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,又不需要那麼趕…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:12.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天傍晚就要離城對吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:15.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼快就要走了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:18.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還想多聽你說故事耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:18.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就多講 多講\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.55,0:13:22.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快走啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:24.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,巨乳妹們！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:26.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:29.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,人家好不容易在享受後宮的快樂呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,奧利弗姐姐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:33.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是叫你幫她買香水了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:35.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,香水喔…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雅那戈啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:40.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要五天呢…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:41.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:45.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊… 要五天呢…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:48.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,夢莓\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:49.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:53.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在雅那戈那裡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:55.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,聽說夢莓香水最近很流行喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:59.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,香水是什麼東西啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:04.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼只是有味道的水\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,會賣那麼貴啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:10.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在貧民窟長大的我是不太懂啦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:17.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,貧民窟啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:20.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,史萊姆怎樣了 始？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:21.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要去打嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:23.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是貧民窟啦貧民窟\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:25.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前住的地方\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:28.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,難得來到這座城\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:29.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去掃個墓吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:33.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸媽媽的墓？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:36.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是以前的夥伴啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:39.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸媽長什麼樣我可沒見過！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:46.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要今天莉露來當你媽媽？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:48.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不用 這算哪門子的體貼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:56.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那… 那邊看起來很兇的人在看我們耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:59.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 他們不是在看你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:02.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是看這個好吃的龍\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:17.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這孩子不是食物！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是食物喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:35.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:37.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這家店在賣垃圾耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:40.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然說是垃圾…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,人家這麼講你喔 波姆爺！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:45.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,貧民窟的小惡棍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:49.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,小惡棍？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:50.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啥事啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你回這城啦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有 只是路過辦事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:00.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你女兒嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:03.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 撿到的小鬼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:04.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,撿到的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:09.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啦 你好溫柔喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:10.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:13.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,之後我就叫你貧民窟的小天使好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:14.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如何啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:16.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老頭我要宰了你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:20.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你還是一樣啊你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:23.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爺爺 你是始的熟人嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:27.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊！從這傢伙跟你差不多大時\n我就認識了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:29.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次見面時\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:33.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他正想偷店裡的東西\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:34.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,從這家店？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想搶回來時\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被他拿石頭敲頭了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很火\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,下次看到他我就從後面用力\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:45.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一腳把他踢飛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:48.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,確實有那種事啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:54.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕的地方喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:55.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:16:59.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:02.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始是在這地方長大的啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:19.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍小偷！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:21.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！龍被…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:23.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:24.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你笑什麼啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:28.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-肉來囉！\n-小龍！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:32.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我生氣了啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:35.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露超級奇蹟射擊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:41.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:43.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是誰？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:46.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:48.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是混哪裡的啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:52.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這不是羅頓嗎\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:56.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,聽說你把地盤擴大了呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:58.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看來還挺努力的嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:00.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊… 是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:03.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個… 始先生為什麼會在這裡？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:06.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在怕什麼啦羅頓哥！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,生面孔耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:09.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:11.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你誰啊你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道這裡是誰的地盤嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:15.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是羅頓哥\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:16.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 住…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:21.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（貧民窟名產 人肉串）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:23.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,替我跟薩爾曼問好啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:25.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:50.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始 那應該是供品吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:53.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡就是這樣 我以前也做過\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:03.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,人死後啊 就被火化\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:06.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,變成灰 乘著風\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:09.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,飛到太陽上去啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:11.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他們現在\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.73,0:19:14.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大概跑到某處去了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:18.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,已經到太陽上了嗎…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.53,0:19:21.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,希望不會肚子餓啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:31.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:35.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天莉露是媽媽啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.63,0:19:39.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是跟你說不用了嗎\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:43.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:47.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果始小時候莉露也在就好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:50.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那莉露啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:53.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一定會努力讓始輕鬆一點的說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:55.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好可惜喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:59.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我看只會更累吧…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:05.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,多謝招待\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:07.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,酒 我就收下囉！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 別喝太多啊 波姆爺\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:13.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好久沒喝酒 真過癮啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始 他們在做什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:19.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是釣老鼠\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:21.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,貧民窟小鬼在賺零用錢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:23.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始以前也做過？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:24.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,以前做過啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:27.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也要試試！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只能一次喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.27,0:20:33.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是他們的口糧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:34.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:48.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那隻不錯 就那隻大的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:51.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把牠用那邊木箱裡的繩子綁起來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.29,0:20:57.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,然後從這座橋垂下去…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:01.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,過一會兒大老鼠會過來…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:04.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拿大石頭砸下去把牠打死\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:07.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣就絕對不會受傷\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你沒砸到毛毛蟲對吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,牠是珍貴的誘餌 可以重複用\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:16.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:20.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不想釣嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:26.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要釣！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:29.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天要辦老鼠肉派對！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:33.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊 可別弄死毛毛蟲喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.41,0:21:36.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始 你也喝你也喝！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:37.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:39.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還不行喔 再等…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:42.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,出來了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:47.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-要是始小時候也有莉露在就好了嗎？\n-出來了 可以了嗎…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:50.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這一定很辛苦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:52.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想再受那種苦了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:54.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:58.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！莉露的毛毛蟲！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:22:00.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但多少應該…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:03.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能過上一些快樂的時光吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回 莉露與可可）\n
